            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/rt595wj4442#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Read here at magnification after the first reader left it low. The last figure carries the same crossed form as the month's 4, so the year is 14; the day could be read 24 with the month 7, which does not move the year."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
